            <title>[ZEPPELIN-3492] The paragraph&apos;s table does not scroll if there is a large cell</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-3492</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
